<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-DIAMETRICS MEDICAL STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-DIAMETRICS MEDICAL STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vector Securities analyst Sandra Hollenhorst said she started coverage of Diametrics Medical Inc with an attractive rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the medical devices maker were unchanged at eight in over-the-counter trading.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Profitability not expected until 1999 with EPS of $0.21.  One-year price target is $12,&quot; Hollenhorst said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
